e body then states that a baseline was loosened or deleted. That claim can be wrong.\n\nThe step cannot tell a real loosening from a tool failure. Extend the check so the issue body is accurate. For example, distinguish `.value.ok == false` from other failures, and set a separate output for each.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAlso applies to: 54-54, 75-75","id":"5a9fc79048263a548e8f1f706ea95c99874e1383d1bccdfdfca6d31e97863fe3","intervals":[],"path":".github/workflows/ratchet.yml","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"`drop` output is `true` on any guard failure, not only on a baseline loosening."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"dcb919600b0ebe0dfc8141a8d9117fbe95ce92ab","body":"**Invoke the required `tsc6` compiler.**\n\n`scripts/ratchet-lib.mjs:336` runs the `typescript` package entrypoint instead. Declare and invoke `tsc6` as required by the `scripts/**` convention.","id":"15e443f9f97ee32fc4ff717c80ed40946928956443a11b17bc24ac71b79b0618","intervals":[],"path":"scripts/ratchet-typecheck.mjs","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Invoke the required `tsc6` compiler."}],"head":"b556bf71931cab3a59ef07ecbc4f290bc128bea9","head_tree":"93b37a39215e5d93cf94d731cb4d3bbc46fcad60","input_scope":[{"blob":"43b14dc51ee85d063f6c02966de13c9e13e12b3b","intervals":[[1,94]],"path":".github/workflows/ratchet.yml"},{"blob":"dcb919600b0ebe0dfc8141a8d9117fbe95ce92ab","intervals":[[2,24],[26,32],[34,55],[57,57],[59,63],[65,68],[70,94]],"path":"scripts/ratchet-typecheck.mjs"}],"job_id":"8b5be000a10b360f57e2bf38d96d79c887045276269ee578f775ffbca52a0cc9:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"entry":null,"merge":"db1be774a51130637c31c5932e0099b3c8602878","method":"pre-merge","pre":"fd67d5a2104276e928378582a5bdb94a05cfd99c","source_path":".github/workflows/ratchet.yml"},"blob":"43b14dc51ee85d063f6c02966de13c9e13e12b3b","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":".github/workflows/ratchet.yml","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseli